OL,3,AMurder charge after body found in
OL,4,Awheelie bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a body was found partially within
OL,8,Fa wheelie bin, police have said.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said Mohamed
OL,11,FAbotaka, 36, of Grand Parade, Plymouth,
OL,12,Fwas charged with the murder of
OL,13,F52-year-old Ali Barzai. The force said
OL,14,FAbotaka was due to appear in court on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FPolice said Barzai's body was found in
OL,18,Fa service lane off Grand Parade at
OL,19,Fabout 06:40 BST on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
