OL,3,AMurder charge after body found in
OL,4,Awheelie bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Chris Lithgow urged people not
OL,7,Fto speculate and said a heightened
OL,8,Fpolice presence would remain in the
OL,9,Farea in the coming days.
